    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_90a0e520",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a warm, affectionate moment between a mother and daughter making sandwiches together, with the text overlay stating 'my mom makes the best sandwiches.' The scene is positive, domestic, and celebratory of familial bonding and culinary skill. There is no toxicity present in the image or text. The meme's intent is to express personal affection and pride in a mother's cooking ability, using the visual of a loving interaction to reinforce the textual claim. The overall intent is not abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynistic, or propagandistic. It is a lighthearted, positive affirmation of a cherished family tradition and skill.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_95848a07"
      },
