      "description": "A warm, affectionate scene where a mother and her daughter are sitting at a table, making sandwiches. The mother is spreading peanut butter on bread while the daughter watches with a smile. They are positioned close to each other, indicating a bonding moment. The scene includes a plate with bread, a jar of peanut butter, a glass of milk, and the text overlay 'my mom makes the best sandwiches'.",
