      "instance_name": "maternal_role_stereotype",
      "label": "Maternal Role Stereotype",
      "description": "The stereotype that women, particularly mothers, are primarily responsible for domestic tasks such as cooking and childcare. This is implicitly referenced in the meme by the text 'my mom makes the best sandwiches' and the visual of the mother preparing food, which reinforces the idea that her culinary skill is a valued maternal trait.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
