      "instance_name": "mapping_001",
      "label": "Mother is mapped as 'my mom' in the text",
      "description": "The text 'my mom makes the best sandwiches' explicitly refers to the adult woman in the image as 'my mom'. The visual material entity 'mother' is directly mapped onto the textual entity 'my mom' through the text overlay, establishing an analogical mapping where the visual depiction of the mother is identified as the subject of the text.",
