      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_b3923fce",
      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the mother as 'my mom' in the text",
      "description": "The user is projecting themselves onto the mother depicted in the image, as the text 'my mom makes the best sandwiches' implies a personal, first-person perspective. The user identifies with the speaker of the text, making the mother the subject of their personal admiration and pride. This projection is established through the deictic pronoun 'my mom' in the text, which directly links the user to the visual entity 'mother'.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
